  "problem": "$6 \\leq 3^2$ **and** $6$ is even, **and** $13$ is a prime number.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $P: \\textrm{$6 \\leq 3^2$}$\n\n- $Q: \\textrm{$6$ is even}$\n\n- $R: \\textrm{$13$ is a prime number}$",
