  "html": "<div id=\"question-178524\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">9.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"178524\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><blockquote>\n<p>$6 \\leq 3^2$ <strong>and</strong> $6$ is even, <strong>and</strong> $13$ is a prime number.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Express the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>$P: \\textrm{$6 \\leq 3^2$}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$Q: \\textrm{$6$ is even}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$R: \\textrm{$13$ is a prime number}$ </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:09 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:17</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
